  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wr 203.02 Permit Proceedings. The processing of an application for approval to construct or reconstruct a dam shall be a non-adjudicative proceeding in accordance with RSA 541-A:29, II(a).\n\nSource. #8413, eff 8-20-05; ss by #10509, eff 1-22-14; ss by #13979, eff 5-24-24 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Wr 100)",
